WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.030
Nobody sat down and chose what they use AI for.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.830
It just showed up.

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:16.330
That's because most of us use AI intuitively: for things that come our way, use cases we heard about, or things our team members shared.

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:22.010
It's like living in a big house and using only the room by the front door.

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:26.670
But there's so much more value to discover behind the other doors.

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:28.910
Things you always meant to do.

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:31.270
Things you never thought to do with AI.

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:36.230
And things you tried a while back that didn't work, so you never tried again.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:45.750
So in this adventure, you discover more ideas for driving value with AI, both in your day-to-day and in non-trivial growth opportunities.

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:52.470
Then you prioritize them with FVI: Feasibility, Value, Investment.

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:55.410
And you think through how to address the core ones.

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:58.170
Time to open some doors.
